      "section": "mt-business",
      "sectionTitle": "主要业务",
      "pdfPage": 8,
      "charStart": 573,
      "charEnd": 677,
      "text": "公司主要业务是茅台酒及系列酒的生产与销售。主导产品“贵州茅台酒”是我国大曲酱香型白酒的鼻祖和典型代表，集国家地理标志产品、有机食品和国家非物质文化遗产于一身，公司营销网络覆盖国内市场及五大洲66个国家和地区。",
      "charUnit": "UNICODE_CODE_POINT",
      "normalization": "remove-whitespace-v1",
      "id": "599940e0-a62d-5611-b347-3d2ccadc7746",
      "symbol": "600519.SH",
      "reportVersion": "474905deeaf0f875fc0a1b097a626c0c7852c427faadc5d7fc7816cbf45ea288",
      "reportTitle": "贵州茅台 2025 年年度报告",
      "reportYear": 2025,
      "sourceUrl": "https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-04-17/1225114741.PDF",
      "textSha256": "db708d9937e91d05833e97a89d88f55b8666c98fd7fa093da8aa7690c9203919",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "status": "AVAILABLE",
